bcl.proto in this directory is not part of Avalon. It is a copy of src/Tools/bcl.proto from
protobuf-net, taken verbatim apart from normalizing line endings to LF, and kept here because
the file ships in neither the NuGet package nor the protobuf distribution while avalon.proto
imports it.

